
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>My TV Dashboard</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;padding:4vw;background:#101522;color:white;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
h1{font-size:34px;margin:0}
#clock{color:#cbd7f0}
.hero{margin:28px 0;padding:30px;
border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#3156a0,#59356f)}
.hero h2{font-size:clamp(25px,4vw,42px);margin:12px 0}
.hero p{color:#e0e8ff}
h3{margin-top:28px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
a{min-height:105px;padding:14px;border:3px solid transparent;
border-radius:18px;background:#222e45;color:white;
text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:10px;
font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center}
a:focus,a:hover{outline:none;border-color:#a7c7ff;background:#354b70}
.icon{font-size:28px}
footer{margin-top:25px;color:#b8c4da;font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:650px){
.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
body{padding:20px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>My TV</h1>
<div id="clock">Welcome</div>
</header>
<section class="hero">
<p>YOUR ENTERTAINMENT SPACE</p>
<h2>What shall we watch?</h2>
<p>Choose a tile using your remote.</p>
</section>
<h3>Apps & Entertainment</h3>
<nav class="grid">
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/"><span class="icon">▶️</span>YouTube</a>
<a href="https://www.jio.com/"><span class="icon">🔵</span>Jio</a>
<a href="https://www.primevideo.com/"><span class="icon">🎬</span>Prime Video</a>
<a href="https://www.netflix.com/"><span class="icon">🍿</span>Netflix</a>
<a href="https://www.google.com/"><span class="icon">🔎</span>Search</a>
<a href="https://www.wikipedia.org/"><span class="icon">🌍</span>Explore</a>
<a href="https://tv.youtube.com/"><span class="icon">📺</span>YouTube TV</a>
<a href="https://www.jio.com/"><span class="icon">＋</span>More</a>
</nav>
<footer>Use arrow keys to navigate. Press OK to open a tile.</footer>
<script>
function tick(){
let d=new Date();
document.getElementById('clock').textContent=
d.toLocaleTimeString([],{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'})+
' · '+d.toLocaleDateString([],{day:'numeric',month:'short'});
}
tick();setInterval(tick,15000);
</script>
</body>
</html>
